  "body": "Actual successor to bass_cr PR70 head 6898f3dd0ab5acff066fb0239339ec44c8d70398, selected READY node CR_ADAPTIVE_Q_GRID_FROM_ENVELOPE_WIDTH. Add executable adaptive_q.py, adaptive_benchmark.py, prefix_benchmark.py, adaptive_parallel.py, 16 new tests, full analysis/DAG and scalar+xTensor CAS evidence. The source-conditioned packet oracle provides TRUE child photon N/U; the algorithm refuses to invent them from only parent moments. Positive exact Fraction prefix ensures byte-identical source mass and first-energy moment on every split. Heap picks current cell contribution to H/He frozen-gas one-step shape-free envelope widths, puts exact physical fit cutoff 13.60/24.59/54.42 boundaries into the q-grid, refines only affected templates and intersects old/new outer dyadic global intervals to enforce monotone enclosure. Precision unmet at maximum cells is HOLD, not PASS. Same stored BB50K native48 packet corpus, proper gas and dt1e10s: adaptive HeI width vs same-state-count uniform q grid at96 cells 1.67211982329e-10 vs1.17761487050e-9 photons/H (7.04\u00d7 narrower), at128 5.48788129474e-11 vs6.73281121939e-10 (12.27\u00d7). Two-age preabsorbed manufactured packet corpus: at96 3.50586027731e-11 vs7.32052270802e-11 (2.09\u00d7), at128 3.26510158401e-11 vs4.10841976753e-11 (1.26\u00d7). The latter is NOT identical to owner SOURCE07 actual C7 z20/z4 two-age experiment. Source-conditioned oracle is extra information absent in ordinary current N,U grid; no direct full-history accuracy. All six HI/HeI/HeII event and heat true packet values inside shape-free bounds for tested source/hardened states. Query prefix exact Fraction speed vs O(P) scan: 5496 corpus packets, 150 queries, 396\u00d7 kernel gain (not global solver). COLD-cache per-job 4 independent manufactured ray process test 8.229s/3.863s/2.182s on1/2/4 workers, same exact return (no Codex/subagents). Wolfram15.0.1 4 scalar zeros+3 true intersection inequalities; genuine source-hash pinned xTensor1.3.0 5 zeros. ChatGPT environment and actual Ubuntu Dropbox ZIP restored: full 47/47 tests and 31 payload SHA manifest+CRC pass. Repo has 16 exact-byte-identical tracked new files plus previous code supplied by parent PR70. Complete standalone ZIP 163829 bytes SHA256 64a88f6efed8dfd2c8c6b660486f02017b025f7d8cbf1cc176d1187f7453adf6, Drive id 18-HytGMyWzYgjs8ZoF6pjKB9BJ9tmtp2, Dropbox id:BSpOijBcT10AAAAAAD71YQ; remote ACK size plus actual Ubuntu local re-download SHA, not full Google Drive restore. Owner rei_bianchi C7/C8 read-only (HEAD a950711f9cf57eea065d2ce30b15aba54b60bf53). It already has true two-age optical effect, and this advisory scalar q energy optimizer MUST NOT be used to merge distinct ages or directions without verified child moments and physical source/clock. AX08 in progress, AX11/12 pending, old49/guard51 and original 20kBT/FR/CR-RCT-HH OFF preserved. All original owner source/checkpoints untouched; no merge/force push.",
